{"id": "2d7ffb04-2bb0-4d4c-85fe-9d36060ec136", "slug": "nextgen-auth-interface", "title": "NextGen Auth Interface", "description": "Nextgen Auth Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NextGen Auth Interface\"\ndescription: \"Nextgen Auth Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#BAE6FF\"\n  secondary: \"#050810\"\n  accent: \"#38BDF8\"\n  background: \"#050810\"\n  surface: \"#BAE6FF\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"20px\"\n  control: \"20px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NextGen Auth Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 6; favorites: 5; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, animated, security, input, validation, effect.\n## Overview\nNextgen Auth Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nNEXUS CORE View Repository Early Access FlowState The ultimate identity experience, engineered for modern applications. Welcome to Portal Username Secure Validation Enter your 6-digit device token. Sign in to AppSpace W…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: FlowState; Welcome to Portal; Secure Validation; Sign in to AppSpace.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #BAE6FF, secondary #050810, accent #38BDF8, background #050810, surface #BAE6FF, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NextGen Auth Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050810] text-gray-300 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative flex flex-col items-center selection:bg-blue-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background Effects -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center items-start\">\n        <!-- Subtle Grid -->\n        <div class=\"w-full h-full absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.15]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #4b5563 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #4b5563 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 80px 80px; mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%, black 20%, transparent 80%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%, black 20%, transparent 80%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Top Spotlight Glow -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[600px] bg-sky-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 6s;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Directional Light Cone -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1200px] h-[800px] pointer-events-none opacity-50\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(from 180deg at 50% -10%, transparent 145deg, rgba(186, 230, 255, 0.08) 180deg, transparent 215deg);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Header Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"relative z-20 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-8 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-400 tracking-wider hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer duration-300\">\n            NEXUS CORE\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white hover:rotate-90 transition-all duration-700 cursor-pointer drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-transparent text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-all duration-300\">\n            View Repository\n        </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center pt-16 pb-24 w-full px-4 w-full max-w-7xl\">\n\n        <!-- Title Area with Bounding Marks -->\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center mb-8 px-12 py-4\">\n\n            <!-- Corner Crosshairs -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/20 opacity-50\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Pre-title -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-2 opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-sky-400/30\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-sky-200/80 tracking-wider\">Early Access</span>\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-px bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-sky-400/30\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Title -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-7xl md:text-[6rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-white/90 to-sky-200/40 mt-4 mb-4 text-center leading-none\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0px 10px 30px rgba(186, 230, 255, 0.1));\">\n                FlowState\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-400 text-center max-w-md mb-20 font-normal leading-relaxed opacity-90\">\n            The ultimate identity experience, <br class=\"hidden md:block\"> engineered for modern applications.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Interactive Cards Display -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl flex justify-center h-[550px] group perspective-[2000px]\">\n\n            <!-- Left Background Card (Faded/Rotated) -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:block absolute z-0 left-[15%] top-16 w-[360px] rounded-[20px] border border-white/5 bg-[#0a0f1a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 transform -rotate-3 scale-95 origin-bottom-right shadow-2xl opacity-60 transition-all duration-700 ease-out group-hover:-translate-x-12 group-hover:-rotate-6 group-hover:opacity-40\">\n                <!-- Corner Dots -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/10\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-center mb-8 opacity-40\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-circle-linear\" width=\"36\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-white/80 text-center mb-8 tracking-tight\">Welcome to Portal</h3>\n                <div class=\"space-y-5\">\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2 font-medium\">Username</div>\n                        <div class=\"h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5 w-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-full mt-6 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1/4 h-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Background Card (Faded/Rotated) -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:block absolute z-0 right-[15%] top-16 w-[360px] rounded-[20px] border border-white/5 bg-[#0a0f1a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 transform rotate-3 scale-95 origin-bottom-left shadow-2xl opacity-60 transition-all duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-12 group-hover:rotate-6 group-hover:opacity-40\">\n                <!-- Corner Dots -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/10\"></div>\n\n                 <div class=\"flex justify-center mb-6 opacity-40\">\n                     <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" width=\"36\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                 </div>\n                 <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-white/80 text-center mb-2 tracking-tight\">Secure Validation</h3>\n                 <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mb-8\">Enter your 6-digit device token.</p>\n                 <div class=\"flex justify-between gap-2 mb-8 px-2\">\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                     <div class=\"h-12 w-10 rounded-xl bg-[#050810] border border-white/5\"></div>\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1/4 h-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full\"></div>\n                 </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Center Focus Card -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 top-0 w-full max-w-[420px] rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-[#0d121c] shadow-[0_30px_100px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] p-8 md:p-10 overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-2xl transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-[0_30px_100px_-15px_rgba(56,189,248,0.15)]\">\n\n                <!-- Glossy Top Edge Highlight -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Subtle Corner Hardware Marks -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-5 left-5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-600/50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-5 right-5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-600/50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-600/50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-600/50\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Form Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center relative z-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Logo Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner transition-transform duration-500 hover:rotate-12 cursor-default\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-linear\" width=\"24\" class=\"text-sky-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h2 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-8\">Sign in to AppSpace</h2>\n\n                    <form class=\"w-full space-y-4\">\n                        <div>\n                            <label class=\"block text-sm font-normal text-gray-300 mb-2\">Work Email</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"name@company.com\" class=\"w-full bg-[#050810] border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder-gray-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-sky-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500/50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-inner\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full bg-transparent hover:bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white rounded-xl py-3.5 text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                            Continue with Email\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n\n                    <!-- Divider -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center w-full my-6 opacity-70\">\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-white/10\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"px-4 text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium tracking-wide\">OR</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-grow border-t border-white/10\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Social Auth -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full space-y-3\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#050810] hover:bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:google-circle-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Continue with Google\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#050810] hover:bg-[#0a0f1a] border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 rounded-xl py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:windows-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Continue with Microsoft\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 text-center\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Need access? <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors underline decoration-white/20 underline-offset-4\">Create account</a></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Fade Gradient (matches reference blending) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-40 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050810] via-[#050810]/80 to-transparent z-40 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nextgen-auth-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nextgen-auth-interface.jpg", "source_name": "nextgen-auth-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 91, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:55:57.174181+00:00"}